{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112432268010758144", "3_2112432284158849024", "3_2112432299623223296"]}, "author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-20T06:34:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112432323543339227"], "id": "2112432323543339227", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 172, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#139 Visited Chaltabagan Lohapotty. Their theme is \"নিশান\". They have depicted Ramnami tribe of Chattisgarh who inscribed the name of Ram in their body. Very good pandal. Highly recommend https://t.co/e0IVUo8IkX", "url": "https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2112432323543339227"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112398431494995968", "3_2112398439967563776", "3_2112398450767933441", "3_2112398460658077696"]}, "author_id": "1887936048761819136", "created_at": "2026-10-20T04:20:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112398474511876197"], "id": "2112398474511876197", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "পুজো পরিক্রমা 2026 মা দুর্গা চোর বাগান ও ত্রিধারা https://t.co/qORjW7yL21", "url": "https://x.com/Abhijit01629804/status/2112398474511876197"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112394846552145920", "3_2112394846552178688", "3_2112394846564724736", "3_2112394846560509952"]}, "author_id": "851743937668632576", "created_at": "2026-10-20T04:06:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112394912172024276"], "id": "2112394912172024276", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "#আকাশবাণী_সংবাদ_কলকাতা\nঅগ্নি সুরক্ষা সংক্রান্ত বেশকিছু ত্রুটি থাকায় দমকল বিভাগ দক্ষিণ কলকাতার তিনটি বড় পুজো কমিটিকে নোটিশ দিয়েছে। এই তিনটি পুজো হলো, ত্রিধারা সম্মিলনী, বালিগঞ্জ কালচারাল অ্যাসোসিয়েশন এবং চেতলা অগ্রণী পুজো কমিটি। \n#airnewsalerts #Akashvani https://t.co/Sv6mABYajG", "url": "https://x.com/airnews_kolkata/status/2112394912172024276"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112352400594075648", "13_2112352414254944256", "3_2112352477156970496", "3_2112352492717809664"]}, "author_id": "1521913806976217088", "created_at": "2026-10-20T01:17:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112352506609381471"], "id": "2112352506609381471", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 243, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This is Santosh Mitra Square right now, and it looks absolutely amazing! 🤩❤️ The pandal theme is Vande Mataram 🇮🇳🔥\n#DurgaNavami #durgamaa https://t.co/ntnKfh5cpz", "url": "https://x.com/ManishS50138869/status/2112352506609381471"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112256522093031424", "3_2112256536190099456", "3_2112256552191369217", "3_2112256574727262208"]}, "author_id": "3790120694", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:56:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112256610886402285"], "id": "2112256610886402285", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌺 Celebrating Tradition, Embracing Togetherness! 🌺\n\nSribhumi Police celebrated the spirit of Durga Puja with a traditional cultural programme at the Police Reserve, keeping alive the rich heritage and festive spirit of Maa Durga. 🙏\n\n@CMOfficeAssam @assampolice @DGPAssamPolice https://t.co/pDz0DWTEZ2", "url": "https://x.com/sribhumipolice/status/2112256610886402285"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112249016528539648"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112249040251637894"], "id": "2112249040251637894", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 5405, "like_count": 138, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 24}, "text": "Chaltabagan at 11:52PM. No crowd or ad banners.\n\nHome to three iconic Durga Pujas (Lohapatty, Sarbojanin, Simla).\n\nClose to Hatibagan Nabin Pally, Kashi Bose, Nalin Sarkar, College Square, Santosh Mitra, Shyambazar &amp; Sealdah Station.\n\nPUJA VIBES ARE MISSING BECAUSE OF BJP! https://t.co/ZKD7yShUNJ", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112249040251637894"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112247494948376576", "3_2112247598010839040"]}, "author_id": "1098908357132464128", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:20:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112247612514644235"], "id": "2112247612514644235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 24308, "like_count": 96, "quote_count": 9, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "Sribhumi 11:30 pm, what's up with this sudden crowd on Ashtami/Nabami??\n\nI thought there is not much crowd for this pandal. https://t.co/y46GBrro7z", "url": "https://x.com/lofITechie/status/2112247612514644235"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112244042524393472", "3_2112244069774786560", "3_2112244091895554048", "3_2112244110358917121"]}, "author_id": "4764615733", "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:06:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112244134006358113"], "id": "2112244134006358113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 842, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2108533573976506750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍 Haridevpur 41 Pally.\n\n🎨 Gouranga Kuila.\n\n🌟 The pandal is made using wasted hardware.\n\n👉 SO, SO, SO STUNNING! This legendary artist is known for using waste materials for creating pandals. He did both 41 Pally &amp; Tridhara Akalbodhan in 2025 &amp; 2026.\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/BsZKZLqBFp https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP", "url": "https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2112244134006358113"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112233807814537217", "3_2112233807818719232"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:25:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112233816224088460"], "id": "2112233816224088460", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏆 Another proud moment for NISHAAN!\n\nManiktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja 2026 wins “সেরা পুজো” at Pratidin Pujo Perfect! 🌺\n\nCongratulations to theme artist Aditi Chakraborty!\n\n84 Years of Heritage. One Unforgettable NISHAAN. ❤️\n\n#NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/VEAIj78djo", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112233816224088460"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112221956900884480", "3_2112221971060752384", "3_2112221986273550336", "3_2112222001687678976"]}, "author_id": "1794095386228899841", "created_at": "2026-10-19T16:39:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112222011825209741"], "id": "2112222011825209741", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tridhara Sammilani (Tridhara Akalbodhon) 2026 \n\nTheme: Surasur (সুর-অসুর) — The Eternal Conflict, conceptualised by award-winning artist Gauranga Kuila, with a landmark installation by eco-artist Chandra Nath Saha (Tilak). My personal favourite pandal !!\n\n#DurgaPuja2026 #Kolkata https://t.co/T3ZfuAi5DO", "url": "https://x.com/Light6082/status/2112222011825209741"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112155049447325696", "3_2112155062894215168", "3_2112155077024927744", "3_2112155092006887424"]}, "author_id": "2609353712", "created_at": "2026-10-19T12:13:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112155105567097072"], "id": "2112155105567097072", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 899, "like_count": 53, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111871736623104246", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📍AK Block Salt Lake Durga Pujo\n\nTheme- 'Anya Katha, Anner Katha' , adaptation of Bharatchandra Ray Gunakar's poem 'Annandamangal Kavya', glorifying Devi Annapurna. https://t.co/9QEjyeQkRj https://t.co/Kq1ovFxTsT", "url": "https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2112155105567097072"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112139339476209665", "3_2112139363752738816", "3_2112139392005570560"]}, "author_id": "2084548793731895296", "created_at": "2026-10-19T11:10:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112139419637645374"], "id": "2112139419637645374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tridhara Sammilani, on Monoharpukur Road in South Kolkata, was founded in 1947. It began with about 15 to 20 members, and the pujo was a homely affair. The club celebrated its 78th year in 2024. https://t.co/QSL8qQ1R6C", "url": "https://x.com/AhanaGhosh27197/status/2112139419637645374"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112130626350624768", "3_2112130647108329472", "3_2112130663025709056", "3_2112130677307330560"]}, "author_id": "596545730", "created_at": "2026-10-19T10:36:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112130693405048957"], "id": "2112130693405048957", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "#DurgaPuja2026 🙏🙏 The GREATEST FESTIVAL FOR ALL BENGALIS LIKE ME 🙏 some NICE PUJO PANDELS OF SOUTH KOLKATA \"TRIDHARA SAMMILANI\", \"DESHOPRIYO PARK\" 🙏 NOT INTENDED TO VIOLATE ANY COPYRIGHT ©️, CONSENT OR OTHER ISSUES 🙏 https://t.co/hmv9Qut4iI", "url": "https://x.com/satadrumajumder/status/2112130693405048957"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112099012690251776"]}, "author_id": "22793955", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112099068810006898"], "id": "2112099068810006898", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 92, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "West Bengal Fire Services has issued show-cause notices to Chetla Agrani, Tridhara Sammilani and Ballygunge Cultural Association over alleged fire safety and crowd management lapses following the Chorbagan Durga Puja stampede that killed 19 people. Officials have also ordered the https://t.co/LJ7GrCGLcq", "url": "https://x.com/indiacom/status/2112099068810006898"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097407140016128", "3_2112097407140057088", "3_2112097407182000128", "3_2112097407169437696"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097414836531229"], "id": "2112097414836531229", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📰 NISHAAN makes headlines!\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja’s 84th edition finds a place across the press. Grateful to the journalists sharing our story of faith, art and heritage. 🙏\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark https://t.co/R3X70tWnZs", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097414836531229"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112097205490528256", "3_2112097205490495488", "3_2112097205448495104", "3_2112097205448499200"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112097213392580776"], "id": "2112097213392580776", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📰 A mark of faith. A story making headlines.\n\nThe inauguration of Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja’s 84th edition and “NISHAAN — The Mark” finds a place across the press. 🙏✨\n\nThank you to the publications\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #NishaanTheMark #DurgaPuja20d https://t.co/bzz28fW05M", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112097213392580776"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112095360198086656", "3_2112095360202219520", "3_2112095360198090752", "3_2112095360273580032"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:15:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112095368347549904"], "id": "2112095368347549904", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏆 NISHAAN leaves its mark!\n\nCelebrating awards and selections that make Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja’s 84th year special. Grateful to the juries, artists, artisans, volunteers and every supporter. 🙏\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/intW3Vay8q", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112095368347549904"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112095013857599488", "3_2112095013467545600", "3_2112095013459152896", "3_2112095013442367488"]}, "author_id": "779250846580080640", "created_at": "2026-10-19T08:14:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112095022548221988"], "id": "2112095022548221988", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🏆 NISHAAN leaves its mark!\n\nCelebrating awards and selections that make Maniktala Chaltabagan Lohapatty Durga Puja’s 84th year special. Grateful to the juries, artists, artisans, volunteers and every supporter. 🙏\n\n#ChaltabaganDurgaPuja #DurgaPuja2026 https://t.co/AGK3DH3bRG", "url": "https://x.com/chaltabagan/status/2112095022548221988"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112067524682752000"]}, "author_id": "720992905171705856", "created_at": "2026-10-19T06:25:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112067535915102568"], "id": "2112067535915102568", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Happy Navmi Pujo \n📍Tridhara Sammilani Durga Puja pandal\n\n#kolkatadurgapuja https://t.co/hKkT00GrAa", "url": "https://x.com/abhi_twts/status/2112067535915102568"}, {"atta